      "boardOfDirectors": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "position": 1,
          "name": "Paul Soegianto",
          "jobPosition": "Chief of Group Digital Strategy",
          "jobDescription_id": "Paul telah bekerja di lima benua dan di lebih dari 20 negara, termasuk sembilan tahun di Airbus dan lima tahun di McKinsey. Ia melayani lebih dari 10 perusahaan global Fortune 500 di berbagai industri, seperti Telekomunikasi, IT, dan Teknik.\n\nPada tahun 2019, Paul bergabung dengan Blue Bird sebagai Chief Strategy Officer, salah satu perusahaan transportasi terbesar di Indonesia. Ia berhasil mengubah Blue Bird dari perusahaan taksi tradisional menjadi pemain utama dalam layanan Mobility as a Service di Indonesia.\n\nAwal tahun 2022, ia bergabung dengan" TechCorp," konglomerat multinasional di Indonesia, sebagai Chief of Group Digital Strategy. Seperti perannya di Blue Bird, ia bertanggung jawab untuk mempercepat transformasi digital" TechCorp."",
          "jobDescription_en": "Paul has worked on five different continents and in more than 20 countries. He spent nine years at Airbus, five years in McKinsey serving more than 10 Fortune 500 global companies. He has worked in different industries including Telecommunications, IT and Engineering.\n\nIn 2019 Paul joined Blue Bird, one of the largest transportation company in Indonesia, as Chief Strategy Officer. He successfully transform Blue Bird from a traditional taxi company to a major Mobility as a Service player in Indonesia.\n\nIn early 2022 he moved to" TechCorp," a multinational conglomerate in Indonesia, as Chief of Group Digital Strategy. Similar like his role in Blue Bird, he got the mandate to accelerate digital transformation at" TechCorp."",
          "instagramUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/paulsoegianto",
          "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/paul-soegianto",
